cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this analysis code, please cite the manuscript it accompanies.
  Cite this repository as well if you reuse the code itself.
title: >-
  H3K27me2: analysis code for "Histone H3K27 methylation states are
  sequentially catalyzed in cycling cells"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the manuscript "Histone H3K27 methylation states are
  sequentially catalyzed in cycling cells". The repository holds the eight
  publication notebooks that produce the figures, the processing scripts that
  build the processed data from CUT&Tag sequencing reads, and the conda
  environments both need. Raw sequencing data are in GEO under GSE327802.
  Processed data are on Zenodo under 10.5281/zenodo.19489947.
